              "ratingValue": "4"
            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Melody Koenig"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is one of the easiest and fastest fruit salads I’ve ever made. But I did not use the peach pie filling as they didn’t have it at my local grocery store. Instead, I used canned peaches still turned out fantastic. I extended it the second day by adding blueberries and sliced bananas .Some magic chemistry happen because the bananas didn’t go brown or mushy.",
            "datePublished": "2026-05-09T02:59:53.232Z"
          },
