              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "FancyLox9049"
            },
            "reviewBody": "This is so, so easy! I do this same salad often, but use strawberries in place of Bananas and Kiwis. It makes a big batch and I find Bananas turn color and get soggy quickly, and a bowl lasts the two of us 3-4 days chilled in the fridge, so strawberries hold up better. It is a family favorite and looks impressive for occasions where I bring a side disk. I'm always asked for the recipe.",
